Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: libtiff/tif_color.c
Line: 166
Function: TIFFCIELabToRGBInit
Bug type: divide-by-zero
CWE: CWE-369
Explanation: dfGamma is computed as 1.0 / cielab->display.d_gammaB. If d_gammaB is 0, this triggers a floating-point divide-by-zero.

Source context:
```c
